---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate and commercial disclosure"
  description="Church Software UK's current position on affiliate links, sponsorship, rankings and editorial independence."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Affiliate disclosure" }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Commercial transparency</p>
      <h1>Affiliate and commercial disclosure</h1>
      <div class="notice">
        <p>
          <strong>Current status:</strong> affiliate links and sponsored listings
          are disabled. The foundation entries have no recorded affiliate
          relationship and are not sponsored.
        </p>
      </div>
      <h2>If commercial relationships are introduced</h2>
      <p>
        Relationships must be clearly labelled near the relevant link or listing.
        Payment must not guarantee inclusion, positive assessment, removal of
        legitimate caveats or preferential ranking presented as editorial
        judgement.
      </p>
      <h2>Inclusion is not endorsement</h2>
      <p>
        A listing means the product is relevant enough to research. It does not
        mean the directory recommends it for every church.
      </p>
      <h2>No unsupported rankings</h2>
      <p>
        The site does not publish an overall score or “best” badge. A meaningful
        ranking would require visible, evidence-based criteria and a method that
        respects different church contexts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
